# Agent workflow router

Hub: `docs/agents/README.md` · ROI: `TOOLS-ROI.md` · Full routing: `docs/agents/skills-routing.md`

**Unsure?** User invokes `/ask-harness` — agent may suggest it when the task is ambiguous.

## Phase protocol (mandatory)

| Phase | When | Action |
|-------|------|--------|
| **Sharpen** | Prompt is vague or multi-interpretation | `/sharpen-query` before edits |
| **Plan** | 3+ files, API/schema coupling, unfamiliar subsystem | `/plan-before-code` — **no code until plan approved** |
| **Spec** | Multi-session feature agreed in chat | Vendor `/to-spec` → `/to-tickets` |
| **Execute** | One ticket / one brief | Fresh chat → `/implement` |
| **Parallel** | 2+ independent tickets | `/parallel-work` → **one chat per brief** |
| **Verify** | Before done / push / PR | `ship-check` · `docs/VERIFICATION-CONTRACT.md` |
| **Handoff** | Context heavy, compact detected, or 3+ review loops | `/session-handoff` → **new chat** |
| **Deploy** | Production promote | Vendor `/deploy-to-vercel` if applicable |
| **Perf** | Bundle, caching, Core Web Vitals | Vendor `/vercel-optimize` · `/vercel-react-best-practices` |

Smart model plans; cheaper model implements.

## Skill router

### Harness native

| Topic | Invoke |
|-------|--------|
| Which workflow? | `/ask-harness` |
| New repo setup | `/setup-harness` (once) |
| Vague prompt | `/sharpen-query` |
| Multi-file / architecture | `/plan-before-code` |
| Multi-ticket parallel | `/parallel-work` |
| Session end / compact | `/session-handoff` |
| Ship / merge / done | `ship-check` |
| Fast locate | `fast-ops` skill · `rg` / `fd` / `ast-grep` |
| Embedded research docs | `research-rag` · Neon MCP |

