Parent synthesizes tables (`caveman-signal.mdc`).

## Mandatory behaviors

| Rule | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| **Scoped verify** | Only agent-touched failures block ship |
| **New behavior + tests** | Prefer `/tdd` when test infra exists |
| **MCP** | ≤6 servers — `mcp-routing.mdc` profile |
| **No auto-compact continue** | Compacted mid-task → `/session-handoff` + new chat |
| **Subagent budget** | `caveman-explore` / `highspeed` for locate; thinking models for schema/adversarial only |

## Do not

- Install marketplace skill dumps · push through auto-compact · skip ship-check on done claims
